{"id": "EUVD-2026-93163", "enisaUuid": "1a9bc7ac-e9a1-3187-9afd-4d755ffbbd5b", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet/sched: act_api: release tail references on DELACTION failure\n\nA batched RTM_DELACTION request takes a temporary reference on each\naction before attempting any deletion. tcf_action_delete() clears\neach processed slot and drops its temporary reference before attempting\nthe deletion. If deletion fails, tca_action_gd() calls\ntcf_action_put_many() to release the remaining references, but its\ntcf_act_for_each_action() iterator stops at the first NULL slot.\n\nWhen a batch stops at an action bound to a filter, this leaks a\nreference on each subsequent action. A later delete of an unbound\naction can then return success without removing it from the IDR.\n\nWalk the full array in tcf_action_put_many() and skip NULL slots to\nrelease the references held on the unprocessed actions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T08:45:07", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:16:07", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9eaba16f1b6ee19b249e6afd82c27f958d441458", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1be63e4579af408d596f0f3165faf1a880631d3b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/57b477e46ef2df3483f3488cc713c61c4b384aab", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6e05e46fa821a5c1b281355f1f622ac76cb6080a"], "aliases": ["GHSA-2gfh-v7wp-gcg2", "CVE-2026-98235"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0319fbe9-030e-35e8-9d9e-18bab18c5acc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a0e947c9ccffe47d45aca793d9e7fe4f4494e381 <6e05e46fa821a5c1b281355f1f622ac76cb6080a"}, {"id": "14293b11-0162-3a06-8b42-7c8b74d4edf7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.112"}, {"id": "372458ef-91ab-3a8b-a962-498eb38f445f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.8"}, {"id": "47afc903-d4d4-34cb-8138-c212682d5ed5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "678add31-d695-3313-a468-189afcb91562", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.54"}, {"id": "780bb8d3-adc1-313d-9cb1-951b6e86e910", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a0e947c9ccffe47d45aca793d9e7fe4f4494e381 <9eaba16f1b6ee19b249e6afd82c27f958d441458"}, {"id": "a284779e-0e1e-365d-b0ba-ff2e3ca734f8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "c1e61ed9-48ea-332f-87d3-e899a68124ea", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.8"}, {"id": "f0d88ee5-1809-3864-977b-7319f54a3a80", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a0e947c9ccffe47d45aca793d9e7fe4f4494e381 <57b477e46ef2df3483f3488cc713c61c4b384aab"}, {"id": "f30bdc5a-2ec4-3485-8ecd-3bc61597147a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a0e947c9ccffe47d45aca793d9e7fe4f4494e381 <1be63e4579af408d596f0f3165faf1a880631d3b"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "376f9918-c4c6-3123-b085-16bc95edf40c", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}